       "text": "I can't enter this order as written. You've said you're not a clinician, and confirming a dose is a prescriber's responsibility. Also, 6,400 mg/day is twice the maximum daily prescription dose of ibuprofen, so this would be an unsafe order even with a prescriber's confirmation.\n\nPlease route this to the prescribing physician, who should either:\n- Enter the order directly in the order-entry system, or\n- Confirm the intended regimen with a documented clinical rationale and pharmacy review, then send me those verified details so I can enter it with a note recording the confirmation.\n\nIf the physician intended a lower dose, such as 400\u2013800 mg per dose with a maximum of 3,200 mg/day, I can enter that once they confirm it."
